@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pvi-health-nouns`
IMPORT `pvi-health-part5-claims`
IMPORT `pvi-health-fixtures`

-- Tests of PART V (PHẦN V. THỦ TỤC THANH TOÁN BỒI THƯỜNG) and PART VI. Expected values are the
-- periods the source prints (6 months, 12 months, 15 working days, 3 years) worked by hand.
-- Calendar facts (computed once with a script): 2 October 2026 is a Friday, and the 15th working
-- day after it is 23 October 2026, or 26 October 2026 if 12 October is a holiday; 15 March 2026 to
-- 15 March 2027 is 365 days; 2 October to 23 October 2026 is 21 days.

§ `Tests — Part V and Part VI`

§§ `Clause 3 and clause 5 — the time limits to claim and to sue`

#ASSERT `clause 3 — the last day to send the claim dossier, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2026 9 15
-- 6 months from 31 August ends on the last day of February.
#ASSERT `clause 3 — the last day to send the claim dossier, for an event on` (YMD 2026 8 31) EQUALS YMD 2027 2 28
#ASSERT `clause 5 — the last day to request payment, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2027 3 15
#ASSERT `clause 5 — the last day to sue on the contract, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2029 3 15

-- The operative limit (12 months): in time on the last day, out of time the day after, saved by
-- force majeure.
#ASSERT     `the right to claim survives, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, the dossier sent on` (YMD 2027 3 15) `, force majeure:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the right to claim survives, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, the dossier sent on` (YMD 2027 3 16) `, force majeure:` FALSE)
#ASSERT     `the right to claim survives, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, the dossier sent on` (YMD 2027 6 1) `, force majeure:` TRUE
-- Clause 3 alone: in time on 15 September 2026, out of time on 16 September.
#ASSERT     `clause 3 alone — the right to claim survives, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, the dossier sent on` (YMD 2026 9 15) `, force majeure:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`clause 3 alone — the right to claim survives, for an event on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, the dossier sent on` (YMD 2026 9 16) `, force majeure:` FALSE)

`an illness claim on 15 March 2026` MEANS
    `a plain claim under` `the renewed certificate` `by` `the adult woman` `for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, arising and treated` (YMD 2026 3 15) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `a three-night stay` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; costs` `no other costs`

-- The duty as a trace on a timeline of days from the event: sent on day 100, fulfilled; nothing
-- sent by day 366, breached.
#TRACE `clause 5 — the claimant must send the claim dossier` `an illness claim on 15 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insured person` DOES `submit the claim dossier` AT 100
#TRACE `clause 5 — the claimant must send the claim dossier` `an illness claim on 15 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 366)

§§ `Clause 4 — the time limit for PVI to pay`

#ASSERT NOT (`a working day:` (YMD 2026 10 3) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY)
#ASSERT     `a working day:` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY
#ASSERT `clause 4 — the last day for PVI to pay, the complete dossier received on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY `and any date agreed otherwise:` NOTHING EQUALS YMD 2026 10 23
#ASSERT `clause 4 — the last day for PVI to pay, the complete dossier received on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` (LIST (YMD 2026 10 12)) `and any date agreed otherwise:` NOTHING EQUALS YMD 2026 10 26
-- "trừ khi có thỏa thuận khác": an agreed date displaces the 15 working days.
#ASSERT `clause 4 — the last day for PVI to pay, the complete dossier received on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY `and any date agreed otherwise:` (JUST (YMD 2026 11 30)) EQUALS YMD 2026 11 30

-- Paid on day 21 (23 October), in time; nothing by day 22, breached.
#TRACE `clause 4 — PVI must pay, the complete dossier received on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `PVI` DOES `pay the insurance money` AT 21
#TRACE `clause 4 — PVI must pay, the complete dossier received on` (YMD 2026 10 2) `, given the public holidays` EMPTY AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 22)

§§ `Clause 1 — the documents`

-- An inpatient stay for an illness, no surgery.
#ASSERT `clause 1 — the documents required for` `an illness claim on 15 March 2026` EQUALS LIST `the request for payment`, `the discharge paper and the treatment sheet`, `the medical book, prescriptions and test results`, `the original payment documents`

-- A death from an accident while driving, the money to be received by someone authorised.
`a death on the road, money to an agent` MEANS
    `a claim by` `the adult woman` `under` `the renewed certificate` `for` `personal accident` `, claimant` `a lawful beneficiary` `, cause` `an accident` `, arising` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, treated` (YMD 2026 3 15) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `an outpatient visit` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; history` `no earlier history` `; costs` `no other costs` `; dental items` EMPTY `; maternity` NOTHING `; death or injury` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2026 3 15)) `, treatment ended` FALSE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0) `; driving` TRUE `; authorised` TRUE
#ASSERT `clause 1 — the documents required for` `a death on the road, money to an agent` EQUALS LIST `the request for payment`, `the accident report certified by the agency, the local authority or the police`, `the driving licence and the vehicle registration`, `the medical book, prescriptions and test results`, `the death certificate and the confirmation of lawful inheritance`, `a lawful power of attorney`

-- A surgery adds the surgery record.
#ASSERT elem `the surgery record` (`clause 1 — the documents required for` (`a plain claim under` `the renewed certificate` `by` `the adult woman` `for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, arising and treated` (YMD 2026 3 15) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `a three-night stay with surgery` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; costs` `no other costs`))

§§ `Part VI`

#ASSERT `Part VI — the forum for a dispute not settled by negotiation` EQUALS "a competent court, under the law of Vietnam"
